A lightweight and completely ad-free calculator app built with Android Studio.

Features
➕ Addition
➖ Subtraction
✖️ Multiplication
➗ Division
🔢 Decimal calculations
💯 Percentage calculations
🎨 Clean light-themed interface
🚫 No advertisements
Screenshots

Add screenshots here.

Built With
Android Studio
Java/Kotlin
XML Layouts
Installation
Download or clone the repository.
Open the project in Android Studio.
Build and run the application on your Android device or emulator.
Purpose

This project was created as a simple calculator application to practice Android app development and user interface design.

